OL,3,GNEWSA'Forget Notting Hill - we set our
OL,4,Anew romcom in the east end of Glasgow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe indie film - by writer and director
OL,7,FKevin Walls - was shot across the city,
OL,8,Fmeaning landmarks such as Kelvingrove
OL,9,FArt Gallery pop up - a well as the less
OL,10,Fobvious location of an east end flat.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
